          <dl><div><dt>일평균 중앙값</dt><dd>${C(i.medianViewsPerDay)}</dd></div><div><dt>반응률 중앙값</dt><dd>${i.medianEngagementRate===null?"—":`${(i.medianEngagementRate*100).toFixed(2)}%`}</dd></div><div><dt>평균 조회율</dt><dd>${i.medianAveragePercentageViewed===null?"—":`${i.medianAveragePercentageViewed.toFixed(1)}%`}</dd></div></dl>
